%% Phase4 / timeline / G-10a 加载 older 历史
%% Helix owners: query/local_first.rs; timeline_navigation.rs; port_reply/dispatch_read.rs; event/timeline.rs
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant UI as PC Angular UI
  participant Gate as messageV3ImGate
  participant Native as Tauri/Native
  participant FFI as Mobile FFI
  participant Web as Browser/Web
  participant E as ExecutionShell/Tick
  participant IM as helix-im
  participant Host as driver-host
  participant DB as tenant SQLite
  participant Go as Go IM server
  participant Sink as EventSink/adapter

  UI->>Gate: queryMessages(latest prerequisite)
  Gate->>Native: invokeAccepted("im_query_messages_by_channel", latest payload)
  Native->>E: Tick::Command(latest)
  E->>IM: local-first latest window
  IM->>Host: Persist Scan coverage around oldest row
  Host->>DB: read local older coverage/token
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(coverage/token)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply

  alt PC older request
    UI->>Gate: queryMessages(direction=older)
    Gate->>Native: invokeAccepted("im_load_older_context", {anchor,token})
    Native->>E: Tick::Command(older)
  else Mobile older request
    FFI->>E: helix_command("im_load_older_context", payload)
  else Web older request
    Web->>E: invoke("im_load_older_context", payload)
  end
  E->>IM: handle_query_command(older)
  alt local older page complete
    IM->>Host: Persist ScopedGet older page
    Host->>DB: readback ordered page
    DB-->>Host: PortReply(readback)
  else local miss
    IM->>Host: Effect::Http GET older context
    Host->>Go: HTTP older page(anchor,opaque token)
    Go-->>Host: older rows + next/prev token
    Host->>E: PortReply(remote page)
    IM->>Host: Effect::PersistAtomic(rows + cursor)
    Host->>DB: durable write before terminal event
    DB-->>Host: PortReply(PersistOk)
    Host->>E: Tick::PortReply
    IM->>Host: Persist ScopedGet older page
    Host->>DB: readback page
    DB-->>Host: PortReply(readback)
  end
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(readback)
  IM->>Sink: Emit im:timeline:update(direction=older,rows,pageToken)
  Sink-->>UI: Native bus -> prepend page, preserve anchor
  Sink-->>FFI: batch raw timeline update
  Sink-->>Web: EventBatch raw timeline update
  alt HTTP/Persist failure
    IM->>Sink: Emit im:read:result(req_id,error) or current failed timeline state
  end
  Note over IM,Sink: current production local-first uses timeline events；tests/旧 spec 的 im:read:result 是 drift，不能混作第二条业务协议。
